      "line_066": {
        "id": "line_066",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "你岂可拿它当雀鸟玩耍吗？岂可为你的幼女将它拴住吗？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_066:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_067": {
        "id": "line_067",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "搭伙的渔夫岂可拿它当货物吗？能把它分给商人吗？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_067:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_068": {
        "id": "line_068",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "你能用倒钩枪扎满它的皮，能用鱼叉叉满它的头吗？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_068:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_069": {
        "id": "line_069",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "你按手在它身上，想与它争战，就不再这样行吧。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_069:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_070": {
        "id": "line_070",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "人指望捉拿它是徒然的。一见它，岂不丧胆吗？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_070:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_071": {
        "id": "line_071",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "没有那么凶猛的人敢惹它。这样，谁能在我面前站立得住呢？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_071:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_072": {
        "id": "line_072",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "谁先给我什么，使我偿还呢？天下万物都是我的。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_072:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_073": {
        "id": "line_073",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "论到利维坦的肢体和其大力，并美好的骨骼，我不能缄默不言。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_073:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_074": {
        "id": "line_074",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "谁能剥它的外衣？谁能进它上下牙骨之间呢？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_074:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_075": {
        "id": "line_075",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "谁能开它的腮颊？它牙齿四围是可畏的。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_075:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_076": {
        "id": "line_076",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "它以坚固的鳞甲为可夸，紧紧合闭，封得严密。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_076:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_077": {
        "id": "line_077",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "这鳞甲一一相连，甚至气不得透入其间，",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_077:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_078": {
        "id": "line_078",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "都是互相联络，胶结，不能分离。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_078:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_079": {
        "id": "line_079",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "它打喷嚏就发出光来。它眼睛好像早晨的光线。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_079:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_080": {
        "id": "line_080",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "从它口中发出烧着的火把，与飞迸的火星。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_080:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_081": {
        "id": "line_081",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "从它鼻孔冒出烟来，如烧开的锅和点着的芦苇。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_081:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_082": {
        "id": "line_082",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "它的气点着煤炭，有火焰从它口中发出。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_082:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_083": {
        "id": "line_083",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "它颈项中存着劲力。在它面前的都恐吓蹦跳。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_083:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_084": {
        "id": "line_084",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "它的肉块互相联络，紧贴其身，不能摇动。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_084:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_085": {
        "id": "line_085",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "它的心结实如石头，如下磨石那样结实。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_085:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_086": {
        "id": "line_086",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "它一起来，勇士都惊恐，心里慌乱，便都昏迷。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_086:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_087": {
        "id": "line_087",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "人若用刀，用枪，用标枪，用尖枪扎它，都是无用。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_087:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_088": {
        "id": "line_088",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "它以铁为干草，以铜为烂木。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_088:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_089": {
        "id": "line_089",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "箭不能恐吓它使它逃避。弹石在它看为碎秸。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_089:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_090": {
        "id": "line_090",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "棍棒算为禾秸。它嗤笑短枪飕的响声。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_090:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_091": {
        "id": "line_091",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "它肚腹下如尖瓦片，它如钉耙经过淤泥。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_091:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_092": {
        "id": "line_092",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "它使深渊开滚如锅，使洋海如锅中的膏油。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_092:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_093": {
        "id": "line_093",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "它行的路随后发光，令人想深渊如同白发。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_093:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_094": {
        "id": "line_094",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "在地上没有像它造的那样，无所惧怕。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_094:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_095": {
        "id": "line_095",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "克苏鲁",
          "text": "凡高大的，它无不藐视。它在骄傲的水族上作王。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_095:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_096": {
        "id": "line_096",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "大衮",
          "text": "克总发糖。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_096:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_097": {
        "id": "line_097",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "感谢您的启示。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_097:continue"
        }
      },
